   2148  fd68							; SetupScorePointers — score digit ptrs + #18 LV001 banner (#18):
   2149  fd68							; first frame zeroes ScoreTh/Hu/Te (Temp = $AD first-frame flag); every
   2150  fd68							; frame points scorePtr1-6 at DigitGfx+digit*8 (right-aligned "00ThHu.."),
